Package: peatsaudio
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Maintainer: OpenPeats contributors <39313803+Wasabules@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/@REPO@
Description: Open control for SoundPEATS earbuds
 PeatsAudio drives SoundPEATS earbuds over the RFCOMM/SPP control protocol:
 noise cancelling and its sub-modes, a parametric equaliser, LDAC and
 multipoint, per-earbud and case batteries, game mode, LE Audio and voice
 prompts.
 .
 The interface is English with French included, and follows the system
 language.
 .
 Unofficial project, with no affiliation to SoundPEATS. It exists for
 interoperability: the manufacturer ships no desktop application.
